65d681ce40", "user_turn_count": 5, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 348], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "f1e608dba62cd2a8db2e4a11f43425d78af956ed60a5a84e6ba7dadcef17a1ab", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 297], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "2d461a194afe591b441a0e32853905318ab4c4e50923aa41578cfa4a136e1c7a", "role": "user", "sequence": 4}, {"character_range": [0, 208], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "230b684cba78f5a253b33ffc750b5c8fb805c54ee445ed9a31ffd4f9ad30f76c", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}, {"character_range": [0, 180], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "5a840f0f7f6fafcba4de67ea114d00bc1e6503498b36a4e55a08a691ac2f6ab1", "role": "user", "sequence": 10}, {"character_range": [0, 33], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "d06a15abdd63b6b72faaee73e1e5310edc0cac08a4c10edcda367dbaf4fd1b7b", "role": "user", "sequence": 13}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "错题知识网络/可视化错题详情/高等数学/GS-698\\_102318柱面曲面积分投影.md&#x20;\n\n这道题我也不知道怎么下手。\n\n我知道 dS 公式（刚才那道题也提到过）：\ndS = √(1 + (∂z/∂x)² + (∂z/∂y)²) dxdy\n\n这道题我也想着把 dS 转化成 dxdy，然后 dxdy 积分区域是 x² + y² = R²，也就是换成极坐标 x = r cosθ，y = r sinθ 代入到角度关系去做。\n\n但我现在卡住的点主要有两个：\n\n1. 我不知道这个 z 怎么用 x 和 y 去表达\n2. x² + y² = R² 是个圆，但题目说了 x = 0、y = 0，截在第一卦限了，那 θ 角还是 0 到 2π 吗？还是会发生变化？\n\n所以这道题我不知道该怎么切入"}